sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SU as Sales user
  participant SF as Salesforce
  participant EH as Event Hubs
  participant SY as Sync
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant APP as Domain services
  actor AU as Subscriptions user
  SU->>SF: edit opportunity
  SF-->>EH: change event
  EH->>SY: in order per record
  SY->>DB: update read copy
  AU->>APP: edit subscription
  APP->>DB: save + outbox row
  APP-->>SY: domain event
  SY-->>SF: write back if still read
